"these targets."
msgstr "VR 遥操作根据 VR 手柄追踪发布末端执行器位姿目标。随后由 MPC 控制器生成关节轨迹以跟随这些目标。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-vr_teleop.md:12
#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-vr_teleop.md:29 a29bc0c52b284db9a65aa079ccf34f87
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "设置"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-vr_teleop.md:31 f28979620c584521af53f54710da9b76
msgid "1. Install fa-py-libraries"
msgstr "1. 安装 fa-py-libraries"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-vr_teleop.md:33 dd9860f08661498ca73eb119a034c03c
msgid ""
"cd ~/\n"
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-py-libraries.git\n"
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"pip install -e .\n"
msgstr ""
"cd ~/\n"
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-py-libraries.git\n"
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"pip install -e .\n"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-vr_teleop.md:40 1557513975004a439bb2505394ddc184
msgid "2. Start Robot Demo"
msgstr "2. 启动机器人演示"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-vr_teleop.md:42 c92f32384d8449dbb5793a6e4c0b2e2c
msgid ""
"source ~/open-deploy-ws/install/setup.bash\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py hardware:=mock\n"
msgstr ""
"source ~/open-deploy-ws/install/setup.bash\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py hardware:=mock\n"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-vr_teleop.md:47 1ade279390ff4bbfb7b35e9305f9fe61
msgid "3. Start VR Bridge"
msgstr "3. 启动 VR 桥接"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-vr_teleop.md:49 1a1e55c09f69401a9cfbf9601ae393f7
msgid "In a new terminal:"
msgstr "在新终端中："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-vr_teleop.md:51 192a900344da4582bc6e38a5fd8f27e7
msgid ""
"cd ~/fa-py-libraries\n"
"./run.sh vr\n"
msgstr ""
"cd ~/fa-py-libraries\n"
"./run.sh vr\n"

